  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'To grasp a timeless moment in this cup,

    From one, the youth and memory
    sup.

    From two, the form that now does flow,

    From three, the seed that
    kings will know.

    The Past, the Now, the Yet-to-Be,

    In equal measure,
    set time free.'
